{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524539-kartarirya-is-going-to-speak","id":1524539,"title":"Kartarirya is going to speak.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-26T12:20:20-07:00","id":1524539,"title":"Kartarirya is going to speak.","content":"Up to my knowledge, i am Kartarirya.<br /> It's else up to be disproved.<br /> <br /> I am going to make... let's say a ghoul, to speak in my name.<br /> <br /> It's also &quot;a bit&quot; about History, most probably, there could be some use of what i could &quot;let's say&quot; remember.<br /> <br /> A lot of questions could be interesting, not as much as some others and meeting of some olders...<br /> <br /> Are you interrested in this ?!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.twitch.tv/mvhxn </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@mvhxn\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/@mvhxn </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> \u200bMatters spoken about<b></b>:<br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> \u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27877,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27877-tsimmist","user":"Tsimmist","date":". 10-28-2023, 09:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27877-tsimmist","name":"Tsimmist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27877_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-26T19:02:30-07:00","id":1524562,"title":"","content":"When and how did clan Tzimisce in Europe, that was apparently unaware of the ancient's existence during the middle ages (at least in the 1190s-1220s timespan covered by the DA series), come to rediscover Kartarirya and his brood &amp; vice-versa?<br /> <br /> How are relations of Kartarirya - or his brood - with the Sabbat Tzimisce, the Dracul or enclaves of &quot;Old Clan&quot; sect-independent clanmates?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-27T00:03:09-07:00","id":1524572,"title":"","content":"I love these!<br /> And as a scholar have many questions!<br /> <br /> <br /> Tzimsice lore says, with you, the Eldest discovered its ability to share its progeny\u2019s senses, with which he secretly became legionfold, allowing it to take host in chosen descendants and reap the knowledge of their exploration.<br /> What was it like? What was it like to feel the Eldest behind your eyes? How this effected and shaped you?<br /> <br /> Tzimsice lore also says You were Embraced before the Flood, thus by Cainite account, you are a technical Antediluvian since &quot;Antediluvian&quot; literally means &quot;before the flood&quot;. Do you consider yourself as one?<br /> <br /> Staing on the topic of ancient times, you were Embraced before the Flood, withc means, in the Third Age. The Kuei-jin, Hsien and Hengeyokai speak of the Third Age as the Third Age of the Great Cycle, the Age of Legends. It was the mythical prehistory of the Middle Kingdom, when the Wan Xian walked among and ruled humanity as benevolent masters. It was also the age where those shen loyal to the August Personage battled the creatures of Yomi under shaky truces. To the Chi'n Ta, this was the age where mankind awakened to Heaven's designs and first learned to wield magic. The Third Age ended through the machinations of the Yama Kings, who corrupted the Wan Xian to feed on chi. It also marked the end of mythic tradition and the beginning of history as humans understand it today.<br /> <br /> How was your relationship with the Hengeyokai and the Wan Xian, the Ten Thousand Immortals, protectors of Humanity? And more importantly the Yama Kings? Any of them tried to &quot;recruit&quot; or use you? Have you worked with or to them?<br /> <br /> Moving up an Age, the Kuei-jin and Hsien recall this age as the Fourth Age of the Great Cycle or the Age of Beautiful Sadness. It marks the beginning of Kuei-jin's curse and transformation from warriors of Heaven into demonic creatures originating in Yomi. To the Little Gods, it was the beginning of their exile from Heaven after the August Personage banned them for their involvement in the insurrection of the Wan Xian. The Hengeyokai speak of the Age of Testing, where the treacherous Wan Xian set the Fera against each other in an event remembered as the War of Shame The Kuei-jin trace their vulnerability to sunlight to this time, the Chou Dynasty, specifically. According to scholars, the Fourth Age ended around 1250-1349 CE (according to the counting of the Kuei-jin) or 1735 CE (according to the counting of the Akashic Brotherhood).<br /> In an epic poem called the Karavalanisha Vrana, translated as Wounds of the Night's Sword, the god's appointed protectors of humanity, the siddhittizaya, had been corrupted by the demons they were charged to fight and had taken to devouring the flesh, blood, and souls of mortals. Outraged, the gods cursed them, naming them asuratizayya or &quot;countless demons&quot; and declaring that from now on they would only find sustenance in devouring flesh and blood. This only encouraged the asuratizayya, however, who embraced their sins and gorged on humanity. Dismayed by this turn of events, the gods agreed to create a foe that would make the asuratizayya know true terror and curtail their gluttony. To that end, the gods took the soul of the man most grievously wronged by the asuratizayya and gave him new life, making him a monster so that he and his descendants might hunt the asuratizayya. Though many of the gods bestowed him with great gifts to further his cause, not all of them agreed to creating another dark force in the world. Three placed curses upon the man so that he should fear falling into temptation as the siddhittizaya had, and so the man would forever be threatened by the touch of fire and sunlight, and would also know an eternity of physical and spiritual hunger just as the creatures he hunted. Named Zapathasura, or &quot;accursed demon&quot;, he was then sent out to drive the infernal hordes from the world.<br /> Lets unpack this! So the siddhittizaya aka. the Wan Xian became corrupted and became the asuratizayya aka Wan Kuei/Kuei Jin.<br /> What was it like to see Humanity's protectors fall from grace? And how you reacted the appearance of those infernal &quot;rivals&quot;?<br /> Following the asuratizayya's creation, by their own relegious text, the Ravnos appeared to replace those fallen protectors and started a millenia long war and their battlefield was your personal hunting ground, India<br /> <br /> How you reacted to these events? Took any sides? Helped the Wan Kuei of India or the brood of Zapathasura?<br /> More importantly, what was it like to see the Divine in work? The Ministers of Haven, especially the August Personage of Jade personally cursed the the Wan Xian, the Little Gods, the and a whole breed of new cursed creatures appeared and one of them Ravana embraced Infernalism and became the Yama King of the same name, king of Sri Lanka, lord of the Rakshasa, and a figure of great piety and great evil. How Ravana's &quot;ascendence&quot; effected your personal search of Azhi Dahaka?<br /> <br /> Another of Zapathasura's spawn, Chandraputra ruled over the mortal city-nation of Harappa until it went to war against the asuratizayya stronghold of Mohenjo-Daro. During the battle, the two generals called forth otherworldly aid, forced &quot;the light of four suns&quot; to shine upon each other and turned the river valley red with the blood of thousands of mortals and Kindred. The final battle reportedly lasted for a year and a night, ending when Chandraputra took the head of his millennial adversary and condemned its soul to the most horrible of the many Hells. Again, were you just an observer, or took side? Helped one or another, or they were enemies on your Domain and actually fought against both of them and &quot;protected&quot; your Humans?<br /> <br /> Back on a bit &quot;modern&quot; times, Tzimsice lore says you fought against encroaching Cainite presence following the conquests of Alexander the Great. You battled a Nosferatu methuselah and, victorious, and you took the Nosferatu's haven on the isle of Sri Lanka as your own and by the time of the Modern Nights, you slept in Torpor there.<br /> Perhaps because those later events, an organization formed while you slept - or drifted in and out of Torpor - the Raktasadhu of India a mutual alliance of the the Daitya, Danava, Nagaraja, Eastern Ravnos, and Wu Zao against the ever-posing threat of the Kuei-jin (mostly the Infinite Thunders Court of southern India and the Golden Court of eastern India.), the Camarilla, the Ashirra, the local Sabbat...<br /> ...and against you and your brood, especially rumors say your Child, Ratti-Ben, the Sister of Blood, while not joined the Sabbat, but aided them to use India as the staging ground for the Sabbat's crusade into Asia and forged strong tied with Sascha Vykos.<br /> What was your reaction to this? Have you welcomed such alliance with distant realtives or punished your Child? Do you consider the Sabbat as Allies of you and your brood or invaders?<br /> <br /> The Sixth Age is coming, the Age of Sorrow is near if not started already. It is the nadir of the Wheel, where the August Personage of Jade steps down from His throne and one of the Yama Kings will ascend to become the Demon Emperor.<br /> What are your plans to that dark future (or present, depending on the point of view)?<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","val