eaving somes, probably, into quiteness, as they would prefer so.<br /> <br /> I could have started by the 1200's period, but it is not the most preferable. As keeping tranquility possibility is first to be considered, also related to &quot;some events&quot;... Which could be still bringing risk of awakening of old angers.<br /> <br /> Eventually already &quot;solved&quot; but not brought enought, not yet, to the ears of every kindreds... Being able to keep their sanity is important.<br /> <br /> Will i have a sense about speaking about this 1200's period ? I'm hesitating...<br /> The memory of a large bloody door in the eastern europe, could still be in the memories of somes...<br /> <br /> I consider my relation with the Tzimisce is fine, as to most Kindreds, not much into &quot;wishing conflicts&quot;.<br /> <br /> But i have &quot;let's say&quot; my Gestion points, and i have to bring informations about this, also because it's of concern to the &quot;modern world&quot;. But it is more ancient than your concern here.<br /> <br /> Also this is related somehow to RealHistory and Kue-Jin also.<br /> <br /> We are somehow, for some of us, in a middle-line in between Legend and History. This is also about concern to Gestion, be it of the past, present or futur.<br /> <br /> We must then think about &quot;healing the futur&quot; by &quot;doing properly with present&quot; and &quot;with past&quot;.<br /> <br /> What if i say that a land was stinking ? It could be important detail, but for a now it could makes others uneasy... For a now...<br /> History and what is said is also concerning versions of what is said.<br /> <br /> So i could speak easely about some concerns but not say everything i know about.<br /> <br /> I am somehow hopefull that soon, others Kindreds will bring out informations, and that in concern we could relase more easely informations of use.<br /> <br /> But there are also not only Kindreds. And for example the Exchequer, well known, is too an important matter, to a lot of us.<br /> <br /> Thus it's about concerting with &quot;thouses of knowledge&quot;.<br /> <br /> I will try to say a word or two related to the 1200's and this large bloody door event...<br /> Yet my memory is not &quot;totally complete&quot; for a now...<br /> <br /> Please understand that doing with 10k years of memories, this is not the same as 200years ...<br /> <br /> This is living memory, this is not only &quot;dead written words&quot;...<br /> <br /> I appreciate your questions, really. This is of &quot;some knowing&quot;... &quot;knowiness&quot;...<br /> <br /> This is a period i really have appreciation for, and i really wish to soon be able to speak about it, with some others Kindreds... I hope they could get to &quot;our little Theater&quot; so to say...<br /> <br /> For a now, i was more onto speaking about older times. Because there are some things related to this &quot;modern epoch&quot; that could be spoken about so easely as compared to this still black-powder period of the middle age... May be in some months, i could...<br /> <br /> I hope WhiteWolf, OnyxPath, could be of the party to ease &quot;our communications&quot;.<br /> <br /> I hope i did answert to you as you could enjoy.<br /> But please, bring your questions, bring your questions.<br /> I am ongoing to not forget theses... (for thouses of enought sense for a now of later).<br /> <br /> Thanks you\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27877-tsimmist","name":"Tsimmist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27877_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-28T08:35:09-07:00","id":1524639,"title":"","content":"(Neat, my post appeared! Also... for a day I sware the topic dissapeared O.o Weird...)"