></div> Tzimsice lore also says You were Embraced before the Flood, thus by Cainite account, you are a technical Antediluvian since &quot;Antediluvian&quot; literally means &quot;before the flood&quot;. Do you consider yourself as one? </div> </div> </div>You are knowing that some wordings get only with &quot;technical&quot; meaning, while some other wordings are &quot;poetic&quot; related to a context. Are you knowing if the notion &quot;Antediluvian&quot;, into the Official consideration of Onyx Path, is related only to literral/technical meaning or to a &quot;poetic&quot; notion or both or none of theses ? Whom i am to decide this, Monsieur Shadeprowler Scholar... ?<br /> <br /> <br /> But i have a real answer, it is a personnal sight answer, and i am very affraid you were seeking an &quot;out of the box question to think&quot; but ...<br /> When a dog, has fur, do meow meow as noise, but is a good guardian, is that a dog or something else ? How do you feed it then ?<br /> <br /> Your question is of interrest of course. it is! OF COURSE! But it is not only to me to answer such a question, this is like translation, we have to concerte then to decide, else futur-difficulties of translations, etc... Were you thinking like amateur, ongoing crash-test with trapped-questions ?<br /> <br /> <br /> So am i &quot;Antediluvian&quot; ? This is a &quot;Trap question&quot;, we just explained why. Yet! Onto my personal consideration, what would it change to me that i have &quot;this sticker&quot; onto me or not ? Could i have a peacefulll life anyway if i prefer not this sticker ?<br /> <br /> Did you forget i was actually &quot;living&quot; and that there were other living beings around ?!<br /> Many humans would like their questions get &quot;designed ready to eat answers&quot;. That is near desesperate...<br /> <br /> <br /> You wish to know the futur before the meal, that is ?<br /> Monsieur Shadeprowler, you did think it was a game ?<br /> <br /> WERE ARE YOU GETTING YOUR &quot;informations&quot; FROM ?! ARE THESES OFFICIAL RECOGNISED INFORMATIONS ?!<br /> I am speaking about method, being Scholar this is serious; and i'm sure you wish to participate to serious work rather than &quot;hot topic journalism&quot;... I am sure about this because you have read a lot to not be into unrespect of &quot;Official Lore&quot; and &quot;Process of Official lore doing&quot;.<br /> <br /> Do you understand i did anwer such a way ? There is no space for &quot;mistakes&quot; else only to bring on more difficulties for a group or many groups... I am not onto this! I am not gaming with some to trap others.<br /> I have my Gestion matters onto my part, so i have my choices, then i could do with somes &quot;compatible point of view&quot; and &quot;gestion ways&quot;, but then i am not with &quot;anyone everyone random doing&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yet i cannot speak as offical tongue, not yet. Because &quot;Official tongue of Onyxpath&quot; this is the work of manies, many accepted, recognised workers, doing together.<br /> I have no room for some &quot;beginner mistakes&quot;... So please do to to Onyxpath so there is &quot;work&quot; which could be done, and some of your questions could find easier answer, i hope this for you, you could understand this ?<br /> <br /> <br /> Yet! Yet!<br /> I'm onto thinking you are confused about me.<br /> I have been doing Gestion in Harrapa, and the East and the West onto some matters. It's more then about doing toward a timeline, respecting it, rather than doing with personnal considerations onto &quot;what i wish&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;What would you prefer my Greatness, Commander of the Universe Kartarirya, how could we please you with our doings so you have likeness for us, please ?&quot;<br /> Really !<br /> <br /> <br /> The August Personnage of Jade ? How do i know this person ? What is the name of this person to me ? Did i ever met ? Was i ever really aware of, concerned by ? What i have or woul